    "body": "Fixes #41352.\r\n\r\nIndented `extends` and `inherits` modelines are ignored, so custom queries unexpectedly replace their base queries. Strip leading whitespace when scanning header comments, consistently for query files and `vim.treesitter.query.set()` strings.\r\n\r\nValidation:\r\n- All four new regressions fail on master `298aea738275` and pass with the fix (extends/inherits × file/string)\r\n- Full Tree-sitter functional suite: 178 passed, 1 WASM-related skip\r\n- StyLua, EmmyLua runtime checks, commit lint, and `git diff --check` pass\r\n- Boundary probes preserve behavior for blank lines and modelines after query expressions\r\n\r\nLocal functional tests used stdio RPC with the optional test-ID `--listen` argument removed because this environment does not permit Unix-domain listeners. The wrapper is not part of the patch.\r\n\r\nAI-assisted.",
